  "details": "I saw the new update regarding content tags and I feel like world creators will apply sexual/gore tags to their worlds for the sole purpose of keeping users under 18 out, even if the world doesn't actually fit those tags. Adding a \"No Kids Allowed\" tag will be more straightforward. And yes, users under 18 are gonna hate this, but they're gonna hate it regardless, so might as well cut to the chase.",
